{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16160","headline":"寄上韩愈侍郎 · 王建","name":"寄上韩愈侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重登大学领儒流，学浪词锋压九州。\n不以雄名疎野贱，唯将直气折王侯。\n咏伤松桂青山瘦，取尽珠玑碧海愁。\n敍述异篇经总别，鞭驱险句最先投。\n碑文合遣贞魂谢，史笔应令谄骨羞。\n清俸探将还酒债，黄金旋得起书楼。\n参来拟设官人礼，朝退多逢月阁游。\n见说云泉求住处，若无知荐一生休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}